Name Belgium Note - Herstal Factory #1


Interactability_Text_Line_0 Brussels is going under lockdown. 
Interactability_Text_Line_1 ---
Interactability_Text_Line_2 Weapon production will not stop, but be increased.
Interactability_Text_Line_3 The Belgian Military ordered a mass-production of weapons to help fight the zombie virus from spreading.
Interactability_Text_Line_4 Tomorrow at noon the Belgian Military will arrive at the factory to receive at least 10,000 rounds in military and ranger ammunition.
Interactability_Text_Line_5 ---
Interactability_Text_Line_6 So get to work!
